@startuml
title RF45 — Multiplayer online: salas por turnos e Ultimate Team · Máquina de estados: MultiplayerParticipant.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
state "LEFT" as LEFT
state "AI_TAKEOVER" as AI_TAKEOVER
AI_TAKEOVER : IA assume
AI_TAKEOVER : sem Scores Points
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> LEFT : sai no lobby
ACTIVE --> AI_TAKEOVER : abandona em andamento
AI_TAKEOVER --> ACTIVE : volta antes do próximo turno
LEFT --> [*]
@enduml
